[] exits with 0
1 warning and 1 note in 1 module.
Coverage is incomplete: 1 definition in 1 module couldn't be typed, so
typed rules didn't see all of the code.

["--warnings-as-errors"] exits with 1
1 warning and 1 note in 1 module.
Coverage is incomplete: 1 definition in 1 module couldn't be typed, so
typed rules didn't see all of the code.
The run fails: --warnings-as-errors counts the warning as an error.

["--strict"] exits with 1
1 warning and 1 note in 1 module.
Coverage is incomplete: 1 definition in 1 module couldn't be typed, so
typed rules didn't see all of the code.
The run fails: --strict counts the coverage gap as an error.

["--strict", "--warnings-as-errors"] exits with 1
1 warning and 1 note in 1 module.
Coverage is incomplete: 1 definition in 1 module couldn't be typed, so
typed rules didn't see all of the code.
The run fails: --warnings-as-errors counts the warning as an error and
--strict counts the coverage gap as an error.

